e7\u00f5es.\nA antena JLSM emite em uma frequ\u00eancia de funcionamento central de 12,430 MHz e a antena EPSM emite em uma frequ\u00eancia de funcionamento central de 12,923 MHz. \nEsta rede adquire dados hor\u00e1rios de correntes radiais com espa\u00e7amento de 1,500 km, cobertura radial pr\u00f3xima dos 90 km e cobertura temporal de 75 min.\nInforma\u00e7\u00f5es adicionais sobre esta rede podem ser encontradas  no portal do Nodo Europeu de HFR (https://www.hfrnode.eu/networks/hfr-lisboa/).\nEste conjunto de dados integra os Conjuntos de Dados de Elevado Valor/HVD identificados de acordo com o Regulamento de Execu\u00e7\u00e3o n.\u00ba 2023/138 da Diretiva (UE) 2019/1024, relativa aos dados abertos e \u00e0 reutiliza\u00e7\u00e3o de informa\u00e7\u00f5es do setor p\u00fablico.\n\nDOI: doi.org/10.57762/V31P-H205", "description_short": null, "extras": {"harvest:derived_license": "cc-by", "harvest:legal_constraints": ["Acesso p\u00fablico sem restri\u00e7\u00f5es", "Licen\u00e7a de utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o - CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)"], "harvest:name": "IH - Instituto Hidrogr\u00e1fico (DGT)"}, "featured": false, "frequency": "notPlanned", "frequency_date": null, "harvest": {"backend": "Harvester DGT", "created_at": "2024-08-22T00:00:00+00:00", "domain": "snig.dgterritorio.gov.pt", "last_update": "2026-10-31T01:15:09.673000+00:00", "modified_at": "2026-10-22T13:06:04+00:00", "remote_id": "37a26947-261d-405e-8fdb-865fbae1aa51", "source_id": "653fce23551b554768c2747b"}, "id": "67807499d3ef822d1b59006a", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2024-08-22T00:00:00+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-10-22T13:06:04+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-10-22T13:06:04+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-22T13:06:04+00:00", "license": "cc-by", "license_title": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 - CC BY 4.0", "metrics": {"dataservices": 0, "discussions": 0, "discussions_open": 0, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": {"2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08"